{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_st01","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_st01","title":"火线之中","storyCode":"CV-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"bbd81577f92cdd93de1e39f560f48632bea548f5b5535894eb6b936124598603","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_9"},{"type":"narration","text":"回去再看一眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g1_mine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——这鬼天气怎么这么冷！我就不明白了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它怎么就能这么冷，能他妈这么冷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧进来吧！既然知道冷，还站在餐馆门口抱怨天气干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这是不想把地给踩脏了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得好像你能把雪跺干净似的......给，热茶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗......好烫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今天餐馆的地也够脏的，早知道我就直接进来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪下得这么大，只要来个人就会踩脏，打烊之后我会再擦一遍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要来点什么，豆子还是干面包？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也算选择？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这些，不想吃你也可以不吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能都来点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，看在你是今晚光顾的第一个正经人，我再给你来勺免费的黄油。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这怎么连椅子上也都是泥水——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你们两个，这不是你家，把脚给我放下来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老东西，你跟谁说话呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......你们冷静些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗鲁的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不关你的事，老板娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这样，都是来吃口热饭的，有什么话好好说嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，老板娘，你这么护着他啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拌几句嘴而已，不至于要拿刀吧，你说呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴，否则我连你一起捅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜，不用你管，这群混账我可得好好教育下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"混混拿着刀正想上前，一把餐刀从对面飞来，稳稳扎在他的脚边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再上前了，小朋友。夜深了，还是快回家找妈妈去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你这女人非要——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不等混混挪步，第二把餐刀便擦过他的脸颊，扎在他背后的墙上。\n几滴鲜血落在他脚边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的耳朵？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还在你的脑袋上呢，担心什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你要是再不走，就真的说不准了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"老板娘转身取下架子上的抹布，开始细细擦拭吧台。\n指间还夹着另一把餐刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗鲁的混混","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，咱们走，以后有的是机会找他们算账。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，你的餐上齐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦，好烫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来一次餐厅烫两次舌头，这里也只有你做得出这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一整天没坐下来吃东西了，心急嘛。先不说这些，海伦娜，镇子上的混账东西是不是越来越多了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是伍德洛出去找人，他们觉得没人能镇得住自己了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......不过迈尔斯也真是的，一声不吭就跑去地块外找燃料，最后不见踪影还得伍德洛去找他，净添麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地块上燃料紧缺，他也是没有办法。再说，不管迈尔斯遇上了什么，人还是动物，伍德洛都能在三秒钟内把那东西打成筛子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可万一伍德洛去晚了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，少说两句，乖乖吃你的炖豆子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我就是担心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，这是最后一点黄油了，能不能把你的嘴堵上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慵懒的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友们，睡醒了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慵懒的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"树林里可能有埋伏，先行小队已经去侦测了。要是他们需要武力支援，我们可不好坐在载具里干等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再慵懒的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以劳驾，抬抬屁股，拿起自己的装备，掩护好自己，数一二三。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再慵懒的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦，我的眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阳光从雪地上反射回来，有点刺眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我应该提醒过你在雪原上作战的注意事项，墨镜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没你想得那么周到，只好先用手头的东西凑合一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面情况到底如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少安勿躁，情况稍微有些棘手。这里的积雪太厚了，敌人掩藏在里面不好找，确切标记他们的位置要花点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，出发之前只说任务是来修动力炉，现在又多了清剿流匪......就当是顺手替地块做好事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友们，你们说呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已准备就绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的部下们可都等不及要突击了，队长。现在我们能和达维镇长官取得联系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们回复说会派遣人员在地块入口接应我们，但是地块外的战斗支援，他们爱莫能助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，好感激他们啊，我好怕会在镇子里迷路呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"达维镇仅仅是一个几近破产的采矿地块，我们很难提更多要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"年初他们就向州政府报告了当地动力炉爆炸引发的燃料泄漏事件，但谁也没空管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他们自己应对得不错，没造成大范围污染，但动力炉的损坏难以修复，当地没人能处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，年初的事情，为什么年末才找到我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小地方财政捉襟见肘，事情不拖到拖不下去，绝不会在上面花钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那时动力炉应该还能勉强维持平台的移动，几个月前彻底瘫痪，现在恐怕连最基本的供暖功能也难以保障。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在零下十四度啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到夜里还会降温。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就没有好消息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"地图显示达维镇就在前面，穿过那片林子就能看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再来一条怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......正好，任务目标已经全部锁定，可以执行清剿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接战之前最后问一句，杰西卡和罗拉呢？你把她俩派去哪里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敌方营地。有一位当地居民被扣押在那里，留守的人不多，不宜派遣太多人营救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，知道了，我会尽快结束战斗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老东西，你被吊了一个小时了，渴不渴？要不要喝水？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不说话，那就是想喝咯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（从地上抓起一捧雪）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，我帮你喝个够，别谢我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呕......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求你放了我，我身上什么都没有......咳、咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么呢。雪地里这么无聊，好不容易遇上你，才算有点乐子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别胡搞了，赶紧把他解决掉，我想清净会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，老东西，你吵到我朋友了，接下来你可别再出声了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇葩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都去埋伏那列车队了，留我们几个在这里看守营地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等他们回来，背包里装得满满的，只丢几件破烂打发我们。你这还能坐得住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......你不愿意的话，那我来好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你要做什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安静，我是帮你解脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪帮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"残忍的雪地匪帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢干员","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！老伯，别出声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢干员","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帮你把身上的绳子解开。一路上跟紧我，保持冷静。能做到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢干员","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是罗拉。人质已经救出，你那边怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都处理完了，就是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你受伤了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是......是我的通讯器坏......哔滋......我自己能处理，没问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哔滋......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你不用跟我说谢谢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哔滋......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先送人质到集合地点，一会儿见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哔滋......一会儿见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽抗的雪地暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你拼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从正面送上来，大哥你真是勇气可嘉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽抗的雪地暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一个了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告队长，所有目标已清空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我们也正在回撤，预计几分钟后可以会合，继续等待杰西卡和罗拉——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂、喂？你那边发生什么了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近到这个距离，我们应该没必要再用通讯器了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你非得来这么一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某人说过，有时候逗逗别人能缓解战斗后的紧张情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你学坏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她教得好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这天气真是说变就变......刚刚还好好的，这就起雾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈尔斯先生，其他的伤我们都处理好了。腹部的瘀伤看起来没有大碍，但我还是建议你回去之后去医院检查一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医院？......达维镇的医院很早就没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......正好我们的目的地也是达维镇，顺便送你回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们去达维镇做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈尔斯先生，放轻松。我们此次前来的任务就是帮助地块重新启动运行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们带了一些物资和燃料，这些东西足够让居民们再撑一段时间，直到我们修好动力炉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......你们带技术员了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动力炉早就快不行了。没有技术员，一旦动力炉彻底熄火，地块上的人熬不过这冷死人的鬼天气的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，迈尔斯先生，我就是小队的首席技术员。叫我罗拉就好，很高兴认识你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......达维镇的锅炉工，迈尔斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈尔斯先生，你为什么要离开地块？这附近很危险的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地块上几乎找不到任何燃料了，我出来碰碰运气......既然你们是来修动力炉的，我们可以尽快出发吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，让我问问杰西卡在哪儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，杰西卡？这里是罗拉。忙完了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哔滋......已经全部处理完——哔滋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你赶紧过来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？杰西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡？？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉，你们在哪，我这就过去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗拉？喂？喂？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯器怎么偏偏在这个时候坏了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看坐标......营地呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这周围怎么连一个标志物都没有......我现在到底在哪里？我该不会迷路了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静，冷静......你现在在达维镇外围，距离地块不远......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......只能先等风停了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......好冷啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"叹口气，杰西卡将手放进口袋里。\n她的手指触到了口袋的丝绒袋子，还有袋子里小小的硬物。\n拿出袋子，她把里面的东西倒了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇队长在回程途中遇到强风暴，暂时没法回到本舰，所以我代她来述职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你收到去达维镇的任务通知了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任务内容呢？你了解过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们将前往达维镇，一座发展出了小型居民区的采矿平台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平台目前因为动力炉爆炸事故搁浅在哥伦比亚的东部林带中，此次任务目标是修理动力炉，恢复地块行驶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我记得材料是今天才下发的。那后续安排呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任务指令只讲到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了......告诉你也无妨，等到达维镇回到原本的航线上后，巴伦基地会等在那里，将其拖拽去往附近的移动城市进行合并与回收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您为什么和我讲这些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，从维多利亚回来后，你的工作态度没有以前那么积极了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克里夫先生，我不明白为什么会得到这样的评价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在尽力完成被分配到的任务，而我负责的任务目标......也都达成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在上个月，你试图拒绝撤离源石尘污染区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时附近有人需要救援......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半年前，一次突击行动中，你违抗了上级的指令，执意选择远离居民区的路线行进，险些让整个小队卷进不必要的战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来的方案会给当地居民造成很大伤害......我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而一年前，你刚从维多利亚回到巴伦基地，就冲进了指挥部。如果不是没带铳，我还以为你要哗变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很、很抱歉，克里夫先生，我当时没能控制好自己的情绪......但那毕竟是数百名维多利亚平民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并非不能理解你的愤怒。但你想过吗，如果我们不以最快速度撤离，让“植根哥伦比亚”的黑钢国际被某位大公爵发觉行踪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后会发生的事，放在两个国家之间，叫“摩擦”与“冲突”。但落在普通人头上，就叫“灾难”与“浩劫”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说的很有道理，但我不明白......这和我们将要做的任务有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在提醒你，不要再犯和维多利亚那时同样的错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同样的错误......您这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便，拿着这个袋子，把里面的东西交给达维镇一位叫做伍德洛·比安奇的男性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是否有这位先生的详细信息，比如长相和种族——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没必要，你去了一眼就能认出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克里夫先生，我还是不明白，仅仅是修理动力炉，为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提醒你一句，杰西卡，你是佣兵，你的任务只是生意，不是义务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰西卡拈起从袋子里倒出的子弹，对准阳光细细端详。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突缘弹、点44口径......底下还刻着花纹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......太模糊了，什么也看不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨科塔的子弹......看起来和黑钢的蚀刻弹也没什么差别......"},{"type":"narration","text":"弹壳锈迹斑斑，表面的铜色发棕，即使有强光照射也难见光泽。\n杰西卡叹了口气，把子弹装回袋中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“犯和维多利亚那时同样的错误”......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达维镇到底怎么了？"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，她听见了风雪以外的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别乱动，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也不想挨一颗子弹吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
